1
00:00:00,179 --> 00:00:02,649
(Penny:)So I'm gonna do the grown-up
thing and see it through.

2
00:00:03,616 --> 00:00:06,016
(Leonard:)Well, that is
the grown-up thing.

3
00:00:06,018 --> 00:00:07,488
(Howard:)I guess.

4
00:00:07,486 --> 00:00:09,816
(Leonard:)I love you.

5
00:00:11,123 --> 00:00:12,423
(Penny:)I love you, too.

6
00:00:12,424 --> 00:00:14,524
(Amy:)You know,

7
00:00:14,527 --> 00:00:17,427
(Leonard:)never have I ever made love

8
00:00:17,429 --> 00:00:20,469
(Leonard:)in the forest
while it was raining.

9
00:00:20,466 --> 00:00:23,096
(Penny:)Well, guess I gotta drink.

10
00:00:27,339 --> 00:00:30,939
(Howard:)All right, here we go.

11
00:00:30,943 --> 00:00:33,143
(microphone droning)

12
00:00:34,814 --> 00:00:36,784
(Bernadette:)I'm not hearing anything.

13
00:00:36,782 --> 00:00:38,382
(Howard:)Well, give me a second.

14
00:00:38,384 --> 00:00:40,754
(Raj:)Are you sure you can do this?

15
00:00:40,753 --> 00:00:42,183
(Howard:)Hey, who found
four dollars and change

16
00:00:42,188 --> 00:00:45,488
(Howard:)on the beach
with his metal detector?

17
00:00:45,491 --> 00:00:48,661
(Raj:)I buried it there,
so we could go home.

18
00:00:52,498 --> 00:00:53,868
(heartbeat echoing, gasps)

19
00:00:53,866 --> 00:00:56,066
(Bernadette:)Wait, that's it.

20
00:00:56,068 --> 00:01:00,018
(Amy:)Wow.

